  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.40 EMS incident report (EMSIR)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.40 “EMS incident report (EMSIR)” means the written or electronic report prepared by an EMS provider to record the events of an incident in which the EMS provider has responded. The term includes “patient care report (PCR)”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
